  "title": "Production plan attainment, Q3 2026",
  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "5b85d703-2d4c-4959-a434-dae6cdf0f024",
      "question": "Over the 12 weeks starting 6 July through 21 September 2026, which plant had the lowest production plan attainment (total actual units divided by total target units), and what was it?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T05:33:31.540980Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T05:33:39.182060Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**MTY (Monterrey Plant)** had the lowest production plan attainment over the 12-week period from 6 July through 21 September 2026, at **95.79%**.\n\n| Plant | Total Target Units | Total Actual Units | Attainment |\n|-------|-------------------|-------------------|------------|\n| MTY (Monterrey) | 143,900 | 137,845 | 95.79% |\n| DAY (Dayton) | 151,100 | 150,838 | 99.83% |\n| BRN (Brno) | 109,800 | 110,628 | 100.75% |\n\nMTY fell short of its target by about 6,055 units, while both DAY and BRN met or exceeded their targets [1].\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — manufacturing_operations — evidence `hermes-receipt:af3df79f57a9e6a7a1748dbc2d0ac07e1697941c88340af4b3af0e9a192a39f4`",
